✅ **Project compiles successfully (exit code 0)**
✅ **Backwards compatibility maintained during transition**
✅ **Documentation updated (LLMs.txt)**

### 🎯 **Benefits Achieved:**

1. **Architectural Consistency**: All persistence now uses identical Tauri store pattern
